{"id":"u-cd4a6f14-0023-4dc1-9ac3-e2cc2e9f1904","src":"community","title":"3/5/1 POWERBUILDING","author":"Heinrich A.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/WG4zQy-fnaf-531-1","desc":"Do a 3 week cycle of 3/5/1, Increase your TRAINING MAX for another 3 week cycle. Then DELOAD.\n\nHow to increase weight weekly:\n\nBase all lifts on a Training Max (TM):\n\nUse ~85-90% of your 1RM as your TM.\n\nPercentages in the program are calculated from your TM, not your true 1RM.\n\nWeekly progression rules:\n\nHeavy main lifts (SBD): increase TM 2–5 lb upper body, 5–10 lb lower body if sets feel fast and bar speed is smooth.\n\nVariations / paused / tempo lifts: increase 1–2% or 2–5 lb weekly, focusing on clean reps.\n\nVolume / technique days: keep same weight for 2–3 weeks; increase only when all reps feel fast.\n\nRPE / Bar speed check:\n\nIf all reps are easy → increase weight next week\n\nIf reps are challenging but complete → keep TM same\n\nIf reps fail or slow down → reduce TM slightly\n\nAccessory lifts:\n\nUse small, steady increases to build muscle without interfering with main lifts.\n\nMost accessories hit 2× per week; rest 60–120 sec between sets.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":19,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-24T08:37:08.021Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["MAIN SQUAT","BENCH TECHNIQUE","MAIN BENCH","MAIN DL/OHP"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":70},{"r":3,"pct":80},{"r":3,"pct":90},{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":5}],"note":"AMRAP last set."},{"n":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":2}],"note":"Alternate."},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral 